// The home system's authored starting colonies (PLAN §3.5.1) — one
// Rask mining outpost exercising the M8-B module set: solar + battery
// power, an ore drill on the site's 0.9 ore yield, a smelter running
// recipe.smelt_ore, a sinter running recipe.composite (fix-plan 3.1:
// the recipe shipped but no authored colony ran it — dead data), and
// ore/metal/composite stores.
//
// Day/night (fix-plan 3.6; C09-F3 + C34-F3): Rask is tidally locked
// to TERRIN (rask/body.ron's own convention — "rotation period is
// the orbital period"), not to the sun, so the site still sees a
// solar day — the synodic month 2π/(n_rask − n_terrin) = 141 115 s,
// i.e. a 70 558 s night (~3.27 sim-days). The old "permanently
// daylit" reading was wrong twice over: no such longitude exists on
// a parent-locked moon, and the shipped π/2 site only *looked* lit
// because the sim's locked branch forced synodic ≡ 0.
//
// The EC math the battery is authored against:
//   day side   solar nets +6 928 EC/s (40 m² × 0.20 × 1 361 × 2/π
//              − the full-rate consumer draw) — a spent battery
//              refills inside a minute of dawn;
//   night      the consumer bound is drill 2.0 + smelt 1.5 + sinter
//              1.0 = 4.5 EC/s ⇒ ≤ 317 511 EC per night. Sustained
//              draw is really ~2.7 EC/s — at 0.45 ore/s of drill
//              feed the sinter is starvation-pinned and the smelter
//              runs at fraction 0.45 — but the battery is sized to
//              the bound, not the average, so NO Degraded{PowerLost}
//              window is authored under any store state (a stocked
//              ore buffer only briefly runs the sinter at fraction
//              1). 340 000 EC covers 317 511 with ~7% headroom; the
//              founding seed is a full charge.
// The sinter is priority 6 — it eats the smelter's metal output, so
// it queues BEHIND the smelter for the shared ore feedstock rather
// than outbidding it. The composite store exists because the §3.5.1
// sink rule pins a converter at fraction 0 when its output has
// nowhere to go; capacity 30 matches the csp.tank.ore.s composite
// slot (~2 starter-craft BOMs' worth).
(
    schema_version: 2,
    colonies: [
        (
            site: "rask-mines",
            display_name: "colony.rask-mines",
            modules: [
                Solar( area_m2: 40.0, efficiency: 0.20 ),
                // Sized to the 70 558 s night's worst-case draw —
                // see the header's EC math (4.5 EC/s bound ⇒
                // 317 511 EC; ~7% headroom).
                Battery( capacity: 340000.0 ),
                Drill(
                    resource: "ore",
                    base_rate_per_s: 0.5,
                    min_concentration: 0.5,
                    power_ec_per_s: 2.0,
                ),
                Converter(
                    recipe: "recipe.smelt_ore",
                    priority: 5,
                    power_ec_per_s: 1.5,
                ),
                Converter(
                    recipe: "recipe.composite",
                    priority: 6,
                    power_ec_per_s: 1.0,
                ),
                Store( resource: "ore", capacity: 100.0 ),
                Store( resource: "metal", capacity: 60.0 ),
                Store( resource: "composite", capacity: 30.0 ),
            ],
            stores: [
                (resource: "electric_charge", level: 340000.0),
                (resource: "ore", level: 10.0),
            ],
        ),
    ],
)
